DGR-12: dgraphBuild3() translates labels of slots baseval..baseval+edgelocnbr-1 (assumes a compact edge array) and does not report
labels found on no process. Also PS2-G19-2: a duplicate label on one process hangs the other processes in release builds.
lab.c VARIANT base: 2 vertices per process with labels 100(r+1)+{1,2}, symmetric ring of processes, one gap slot (-1) after each vertex's arcs.
