  pristine (/tmp/claude-1000/-home-dev-workspace-pyscotch/087f3d41-a5d8-4b0a-9260-769d70cf8179/scratchpad/infra/asan):
     noncompact np=1 base=0: build rc=0, edges=[ 1 -1 101 -1 ] (gap slot 1 "translated", real slot 2 keeps label 101), check rc=1 "arc data do not match"
     noncompact np=2..4: same, last real arc of each vertex 1 keeps its label; check rc=1
     unknown np=1..4: build rc=0 with 9999 left in the edge array (then check rc=1)
     dup np=1: build rc=1 "duplicate vertex label (1)";  dup np=3 or 4: HANG (timeout) - the faulty rank returns, the others wait in the ring exchange
  patched (/tmp/claude-1000/-home-dev-workspace-pyscotch/087f3d41-a5d8-4b0a-9260-769d70cf8179/scratchpad/work/G19-dgraph-build-induce/build):
     noncompact np=1..4, base 0/1: build rc=0, check rc=0, gap slots untouched (e.g. np=3 base=0 r0 edges=[ 1 5 -1 0 2 -1 ])
     unknown: "dgraphBuild3: unknown vertex label", build rc=1 on EVERY rank;  dup: "duplicate vertex label (1)", rc=1 on every rank, no hang
